  "comments": "Design varieties exist:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64c6db64c3509.png\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64c6db64c3509.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n1994 has multiple variants:<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5903a40bd8d08.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5903a40bd8d08.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nCredit for the following photos and descriptions: Carlos Andres Zumino, Duberney Osorio, and Bernardo Gonzalez White.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64fe0cd510db7.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64fe0cd510db7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"101\" /></a><br />\r\n1: Large date. Condor wings to the middle of the U and middle of the M. 72 pearls on obverse and 72 pearls on reverse.<br /><br />\r\n2: this variety is believed to exist but has not been found. Large date. Condor wings to the middle of the U and middle of the M. 72 pearls on obverse and 68 pearls on reverse.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64fe0d48c706d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64fe0d48c706d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"103\" /></a><br />\r\n3: Large date. Condor wings to the middle of the U and beginning of the M. 72 pearls on obverse and 72 pearls on reverse.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64fe0dc6d4206.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64fe0dc6d4206.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"100\" /></a><br />\r\n4: Large date. Condor wings to the middle of the U and beginning of the M. 72 pearls on obverse and 68 pearls on reverse.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64fe0e1fc1392.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64fe0e1fc1392.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"99\" /></a><br />\r\n5: Small date. Condor wings to the beginning of the U and end of the M. 68 pearls on obverse and 72 pearls on reverse.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64fe0ec454f58.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64fe0ec454f58.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"97\" /></a><br />\r\n6: Small date. Condor wings to the beginning of the U and end of the M. 68 pearls on obverse and 68 pearls on reverse.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64fe0f02b3310.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64fe0f02b3310.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"100\" /></a><br />\r\n7: Small date. Condor wings to the middle of the P and end of the M. 68 pearls on obverse and 72 pearls on reverse.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64fe0f3970ff5.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64fe0f3970ff5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"104\" /></a><br />\r\n8: Small date. Condor wings to the middle of the P and end of the M. 68 pearls on obverse and 68 pearls on reverse.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64fe0f7241ad8.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64fe0f7241ad8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"98\" /></a><br />\r\n9: Large date. Condor wings to the middle of the U and end of the M. 72 pearls on obverse and 72 pearls on reverse. This may be a mule, with the 1989-1993 obverse and the 1994-2003 reverse.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64fe1011d412f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64fe1011d412f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"98\" /></a><br />\r\n10: Large date. Condor wings to the middle of the U and beginning of the M. 72 pearls on obverse and 72 pearls on reverse. This may be a mule, with the 1994-2003 obverse and 1989-1993 reverse.<br /><br />\r\nObverse<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64fe10960bf8f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64fe10960bf8f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"162\" /></a><br />\r\nLarge Date with 72 pearls (numbers 1, 2, and 3).<br />\r\nSmall Date with 68 pearls (numbers 4, 5, and 6).<br /><br />\r\nReverse<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64fe10cac21a3.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64fe10cac21a3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"169\" /></a><br />\r\n72 pearls (numbers 1, 2, 4, and 5).<br />\r\n68 pearls (numbers 3 and 6).",
